00:23:21,821 --> 00:23:23,780
and forms. With such

292
00:23:23,781 --> 00:23:25,460
pretzel flavors as honey barbecue,

293
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:27,680
cheddar cheese, buttermilk ranch,

294
00:23:27,820 --> 00:23:29,780
jalapeno pieces and hot

295
00:23:29,781 --> 00:23:30,640
buffalo wings.

296
00:23:32,940 --> 00:23:33,800
Hey, that's

297
00:23:33,801 --> 00:23:36,020
a lot of spice for a 1,400 year old snack.

298
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:39,780
Compared to pretzels,

299
00:23:39,781 --> 00:23:41,640
this treats a youngster and it's

300
00:23:41,641 --> 00:23:44,100
having an identity crisis.

301
00:23:44,101 --> 00:23:47,780
It's not really just a chocolate, and not totally a caramel,

302
00:23:47,781 --> 00:23:55,400
and it's not quite a fudge, but it just keeps going and going and going.

303
00:23:55,401 --> 00:23:58,580
While the rest of the country eats hard pretzels at a rate of one and a half to

304
00:23:58,581 --> 00:24:00,480
two pounds per year,

