309
00:24:16,820 --> 00:24:19,320
Candies have always been made with the same basics.

310
00:24:19,780 --> 00:24:21,580
Sweeteners, flavors, and colors.

311
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:26,940
Yes, artificial flavors and colors have made them tastier and brighter.

312
00:24:27,380 --> 00:24:29,300
But candy recipes have tended to last.

313
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:32,840
And so have the names on the boxes.

314
00:24:34,460 --> 00:24:38,560
65% of American candy brands have been around for more than 50 years.

315
00:24:39,300 --> 00:24:41,840
Few have been popular as long as Tootsie Roll.

316
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:52,520
Introduced in 1896, it's more than 100 years old.

317
00:24:53,980 --> 00:24:56,780
Tootsie Roll started as a wrapped penny piece,

318
00:24:57,360 --> 00:25:02,920
and to this day we do have a very small Tootsie Roll that is a wrapped penny piece.

319
00:25:03,980 --> 00:25:07,620
But don't be fooled by its unassuming appearance and modest price.

320
00:25:07,621 --> 00:25:10,240
this candy has spawned a confectionery empire.

321
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:14,440
The output at the Chicago Tootsie Roll plant is staggering.

322
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:18,240
They make 83 million Tootsie Rolls a day,

323
00:25:18,660 --> 00:25:20,160
16 million mason dots,

324
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:22,220
and about 20 million lollipops.

325
00:25:23,540 --> 00:25:27,740
Tootsie Roll Industries grosses approximately $400 million a year.

326
00:25:28,620 --> 00:25:31,400
But like most candy companies, it had modest origins.

327
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:35,100
Austrian immigrant Leo Hirschfeld

328
00:25:35,101 --> 00:25:39,160
brought his recipe for a chocolate chewy candy to New York City

329
00:25:39,161 --> 00:25:41,500
and began manufacture in 1896.

330
00:25:43,320 --> 00:25:47,260
He dubbed his sweet Tootsie, his five-year-old daughter's nickname.

331
00:25:48,280 --> 00:25:52,220
It wasn't quite a bar of chocolate, and it wasn't quite a caramel,

332
00:25:52,740 --> 00:25:55,300
and yet it also wasn't quite a piece of fudge.

333
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:57,240
It was a blend of all of those.

334
00:25:57,860 --> 00:26:02,860
You had hundreds of candy shops where they would be making hard candy and soft candy

335
00:26:02,861 --> 00:26:05,600
basically by boiling sugar in the back of their shops,

336
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:08,240
and in the front of them they would start to sell their products.

337
00:26:09,340 --> 00:26:14,660
By 1905, the Tootsie Roll was established in an already crowded candy marketplace.

338
00:26:16,360 --> 00:26:19,120
Tootsie Rolls were cooked on the top of a building,

339
00:26:19,940 --> 00:26:24,040
and the candy was cooked in open kettles on sunny days,

340
00:26:24,180 --> 00:26:25,980
and on rainy days they couldn't cook.

341
00:26:26,940 --> 00:26:30,660
As time went on, the people who actually worked in Tootsie Roll

342
00:26:30,661 --> 00:26:37,500
began to invent machinery that could begin to cut the candy instead of by hand by some

343
00:26:37,501 --> 00:26:42,460
automated machines. And later on, machines became faster and faster.

344
00:26:44,740 --> 00:26:48,220
Today, Tootsie Roll manufacturing is completely automated.

345
00:26:49,800 --> 00:26:52,296
We are in the Tootsie Roll process kitchen.

346
00:26:52,297 --> 00:26:55,140
We have a total of six Tootsie Roll cookers here,

347
00:26:55,141 --> 00:27:00,180
And pre-mix is cocoa, oil, corn syrup, sweetened condensed milk.

348
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:05,800
And we are cooking about 10,000 pounds an hour right now on these two cookers.

349
00:27:07,120 --> 00:27:12,840
The mixture is then slowly cooled on this wheel to temper the Tootsie Roll and give it its familiar texture.

350
00:27:14,220 --> 00:27:17,240
If you cool it too quickly, it becomes rock hard.

351
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:19,600
If you don't cool it quickly enough, it will never set up.

352
00:27:20,460 --> 00:27:23,840
Chocolate may be the most familiar flavor, but it's not the only one.

353
00:27:23,841 --> 00:27:30,840
The plant also makes 17 different Tootsie Roll flavors, including grape, orange and cherry.

354
00:27:30,841 --> 00:27:35,600
The mixing process for fruit flavors is the same, but the cocoa is replaced with artificial

355
00:27:35,601 --> 00:27:40,140
flavors and colors.

356
00:27:40,141 --> 00:27:45,240
After mixing in a 30-minute cool-off, the roll passes through an extruder and becomes

357
00:27:45,241 --> 00:27:46,240
this slab.

358
00:27:46,241 --> 00:27:50,540
No, it's not the latest in supersizing.

359
00:27:50,541 --> 00:27:53,380
simply the building block from which all Tootsie Rolls are made.

360
00:27:54,820 --> 00:28:00,220
This extruder basically puts it into a 13-pound Tootsie Roll.

361
00:28:00,780 --> 00:28:05,500
And we use that 13-pound Tootsie Roll for the basis of all of our wrapping machines.

362
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:09,600
The slab is conveyed into the high-speed wrapping area,

363
00:28:09,820 --> 00:28:12,560
where it's pulled and squeezed to the width of a Tootsie Roll.

364
00:28:12,561 --> 00:28:22,180
It comes through and gets cut, and then these grippers hold onto it and pass it onto this

365
00:28:22,181 --> 00:28:27,700
next set of grippers, which have already had a wrapped Tootsie Roll paper around it, and

366
00:28:27,701 --> 00:28:31,680
there's two twister barrels that come and twist the ends of the Tootsie Roll.

367
00:28:32,760 --> 00:28:37,940
This all happens at a rate of 1,500 pieces per minute, three times as fast as 10 years

368
00:28:37,941 --> 00:28:38,641
ago.

369
00:28:38,642 --> 00:28:46,040
The machines better get faster because over the years, the Tootsie Roll line of brands

370
00:28:46,041 --> 00:28:48,620
has continued to expand through invention and acquisition.

371
00:28:49,220 --> 00:28:54,240
To include Dots, Crows, Sella's, Chocolate-Covered Cherries, Charleston Chew, Fluffy Stuffed

372
00:28:54,241 --> 00:28:57,600
Cotton Candies, Andy's Candies, and the Charms line of lollipops.

373
00:28:58,280 --> 00:29:03,000
The combination of the Charms line and Tootsie Pops makes Tootsie the largest lollipop producer

374
00:29:03,001 --> 00:29:03,760
in the world.

375
00:29:03,761 --> 00:29:10,940
Tootsie Pops are cooked, cooled and stretched like Tootsie Rolls, but the actual mechanics

376
00:29:10,941 --> 00:29:15,248
of the lollipop making machine are a secret.

377
00:29:15,249 --> 00:29:19,360
Once stick, Tootsie Center and Candy Shell

378
00:29:19,361 --> 00:29:21,360
are combined, the lollipop must be cooled.

379
00:29:21,361 --> 00:29:27,860
This is a fresh Tootsie Roll Pop and as you can tell it's well formed but it's very,

380
00:29:27,861 --> 00:29:28,561
very soft.

381
00:29:28,562 --> 00:29:33,340
And we have to cool it very carefully because if we let it rest on one side or another,

382
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,725
