00:33:05,220 --> 00:33:12,100
To put that into perspective, one of our new generation bakeries can produce 170,000 loaves of bread.

423
00:33:12,980 --> 00:33:17,740
If you look at snack foods, it's gone largely from what was a single batch process,

424
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:23,520
producing a few dozen or a few hundred maybe, to continuous process that's thousands of pounds an hour.

425
00:33:24,520 --> 00:33:29,240
Continuous process technology is in full swing at Flowers Crossville, Tennessee Bakery,

426
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:32,700
which makes more than 80 million pounds of product annually.

427
00:33:33,820 --> 00:33:39,560
The company's auto-bake inline system runs 724 feet from mixing to packaging.

428
00:33:40,700 --> 00:33:43,240
There's two processes to our mixing process.

429
00:33:43,760 --> 00:33:47,540
There's the primary mixing process where the ingredients are blended together.

