00:33:47,541 --> 00:33:51,060
Then there's the continuous mixture where air is injected in,

431
00:33:51,061 --> 00:33:58,420
and we're trying to maintain the same specific gravity so that we can keep a consistent volume of the finished product.

432
00:33:59,540 --> 00:34:04,120
The amount of injected air depends on the desired specific gravity or density.

