00:34:16,580 --> 00:34:20,360
This will allow the baking powder to leaven the dough to the proper consistency.

436
00:34:21,060 --> 00:34:29,080
One thing that makes baking, I think, more complex than some other food ingredients is bakery materials,

437
00:34:29,081 --> 00:34:33,320
