00:34:36,580 --> 00:34:40,520
that dough is continually changing from the time it's mixed until you get it through the process.

440
00:34:40,620 --> 00:34:42,980
So you can't just make a huge batch and work on it all day.

441
00:34:43,620 --> 00:34:45,460
You've got to be timing everything through.

